A paragraph mentions the year
1984. Then it goes on: an N. line with N other than 1 does not interrupt.

A paragraph with a dash line
- 
continues: an empty item does not interrupt.

A paragraph followed by a list
1. one
2. two

Comment lines inside a paragraph are invisible
%-- a remark --%
and the paragraph continues.

%-- a block comment --% Text after the closer is kept.
#let y = 2; and after a let statement: #y.
#{ let z = 3 } and after a block: #z.

+ auto one
+ auto two
1. a separate explicit list
2. continues it
5. numbered out of order
